WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.781
"Play with me, Pig!" said Bat.

2
00:00:24.782 --> 00:00:27.844
"Okay," said Pig.

3
00:00:27.845 --> 00:00:31.081
"Close your eyes," said Bat.

4
00:00:31.082 --> 00:00:33.868
"And count to ten.

5
00:00:33.869 --> 00:00:36.896
I will hide," said Bat.

6
00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:38.610
"You will seek.

7
00:00:38.611 --> 00:00:42.168
You will try to find me!"

8
00:00:42.169 --> 00:00:49.228
Pig closed his eyes.

9
00:00:49.229 --> 00:00:51.455
He began to count.

10
00:00:51.456 --> 00:00:55.308
"One, two, three . . ."

11
00:00:55.309 --> 00:00:59.121
"What are you doing, Pig?" asked Cat.

12
00:00:59.122 --> 00:01:02.251
"I'm playing with Bat," said Pig.

13
00:01:02.252 --> 00:01:05.195
"We are playing hide-and-seek."

14
00:01:05.196 --> 00:01:08.530
"Can I play?" asked Cat.

15
00:01:08.531 --> 00:01:11.519
"Yes," said Pig.

16
00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:15.861
Cat went to hide.

17
00:01:15.862 --> 00:01:18.373
Pig started to count again.

18
00:01:18.374 --> 00:01:22.148
"One, two, three . . ."

19
00:01:22.149 --> 00:01:25.360
"Hide-and-seek!" said Dog.

20
00:01:25.361 --> 00:01:27.623
"Can I play?"

21
00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:30.929
"Yes," said Pig.

22
00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:33.800
Pig began to count again.

23
00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:39.192
"One, two, three, four . . ."

24
00:01:39.193 --> 00:01:43.150
"I want to play too!" said Cow.

25
00:01:43.151 --> 00:01:45.049
Cow hid.

26
00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:47.510
Pig counted.

27
00:01:47.511 --> 00:01:54.165
"Eight, nine, ten!

28
00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:59.117
Here I come!" said Pig.

